 ## [Unreleased]
+### Security
+- Update quick-xml to 0.41.0 and webpki-root-certs to 1.0.10 for the existing worker-source dependency policy; preserve XMLTV title escaping and retention boundaries.
+
 ### Added
 - Optional `playout.layout: "ersatzrs.playout-index.v1"` uses the accepted atomic index, immutable hashed day files and reader lease. Channel schema `0.1.6` adds the reader while retaining session/cache fields; invalid indexes do not fall back to folder scanning.
 - `session.idle_timeout_seconds` in `channel.json`: seconds without a `.heartbeat` touch before the channel stops (default 90); `0` keeps the channel running without viewers (channel config schema `0.1.4`)
